        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. For the purposes of this Article, seniority shall be based on the most recent date of hire in a staff career position. Employment prior to a break in service shall not be counted. When unit employees have the same date of hire, seniority shall be determined according to alphabetical order of the last name.",
            "block_bbox": [
